This patch moves the IBMgraphics, DECgraphics and MACgraphics -config
options into a single compound option:

OPTIONS=chargfx:FOO

where FOO is one of ASCII, IBM, DEC, or MAC. Negating the option sets it
to ASCII.

The old config options are also accepted, but they don't show up in the
Options-menu in-game.

